                <pb facs="0786" n="702" sameAs="frus:frus1886/pg702"/>

                <head>No. 318.<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Jackson to Mr. Bayard.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Mexico</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1886-07-21"><hi rendition="#italic">July</hi> 21, 1886</date>.
                        (Received July 21.)</dateline></opener>
                <p>Instant release of Cutting refused; reasons given at length. Shall I telegraph
                    them?</p>
                <closer><signed>JACKSON,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                    >Minister.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
